Z||000000||tgowens||06-23-2001||12:54 PM||||I have posted this here in addition to the "Club Announcements" section due to the fact that many of you are not currently a member of a Fiero Club...<P>The Western Regional Fiero Fest is coming up!! - This will be held July 13-15 in San<BR>Leandro, CA at the San Leandro Marina.<P>The reservation form is on-line at the CFOG web site........here is the link:<BR>                     <A HREF="http://www.cfog.org/reservation_application.html" TARGET=_blank>www.cfog.org/reservation_application.html</A> <P>Register now and let us know you will be attending, It promises to be a great show!!<P>Also, remember, there is a "give-away" of a 1986 SE at the show!! Here is the link for that one....<BR> <A HREF="http://www.cfog.org/ticket_application.html" TARGET=_blank>www.cfog.org/ticket_application.html</A> <P>We hope to see you there!!<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/index.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>                  <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/3GTS_SIG.gif">                   </A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||c m west||06-23-2001||01:33 PM||||You can count on Fieros West, as well as West Coast Fiero being there - we will run a support vehicle with enough parts to rebuild a car on the side of the road for those of you meeting up at West Coast Fiero - think of it as Fiero AAA.<P>  For those of you who wish to join the caravan, call Chris West at West Coast Fiero<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111||||reg||1
